        <mxCell id="c43" value="&lt;b&gt;The selection came from the sales star and the result lands in the ledger.&lt;/b&gt; Operating Expense carries no filter on Item, yet it reads 1,570,297.47: Both lets the invoice lines filter Date, and Date filters GLEntry. The figure is the expense of the twelve days on which design services were invoiced, neither a share of operating expense that belongs to Services nor Services&#x27; own cost." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF5E7;strokeColor=#FEF5E7;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="344" width="860" height="59" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
